flowchart LR
    push([git push]) --> lint[Lint] & test[Unit tests] & build[Build]
    lint --> gate{All green?}
    test --> gate
    build --> image[(Docker image)]
    image --> gate
    gate -->|yes| deploy[[Deploy to staging]]
    gate -->|no| notify[Notify author]
    deploy --> smoke[Smoke tests] --> prod([Production])
    smoke -.->|fail| rollback[Rollback]
    classDef danger stroke:#f08080
    class notify,rollback danger
